long, with headings, needs a synthesis \tab \code{"survey"} \cr
scanned PDF, forms, invoices \tab \code{"scanned"} \cr
an argument that develops across the text \tab \code{"narrative"} \cr
multi-hop question over a paper \tab \code{"research"} \cr
high stakes, want cross-checking \tab \code{"consensus"} \cr
short, and you want every sentence weighed \tab \code{"precise"} \cr
